# 📚 AI-Powered Study Assistant

An AI-powered RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation) application built using Streamlit and LlamaIndex.

The application allows users to upload study material (PDFs), automatically create a searchable vector index, and ask natural language questions about the uploaded documents.

---

## Features

- 📄 Upload multiple PDF documents
- 🧠 Local embedding generation using HuggingFace
- 🔍 Semantic search over uploaded documents
- 🤖 AI-powered question answering
- 💬 Chat interface
- 📁 Persistent document storage
- ♻️ Load previously indexed documents
- 🗑️ Delete uploaded documents
- 📖 View uploaded PDFs
- ⚡ Fast retrieval using vector indexing

---

## Tech Stack

- Python
- Streamlit
- LlamaIndex
- HuggingFace Embeddings
- PyMuPDF
- Ollama (Local LLM)

---

